[
  {
    "text": "Nobody tells you this in your first data science job,",
    "startMs": 320,
    "endMs": 4040,
    "timestampMs": 320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "but your charts will get judged before your model does.",
    "startMs": 4040,
    "endMs": 7680,
    "timestampMs": 4040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So here is a sample Matplotlib figure for you.",
    "startMs": 7680,
    "endMs": 11080,
    "timestampMs": 7680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "As you can see, it's just age distributed",
    "startMs": 17120,
    "endMs": 20560,
    "timestampMs": 17120,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "for Titanic data set.",
    "startMs": 23320,
    "endMs": 25200,
    "timestampMs": 23320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "We'll go into details later on.",
    "startMs": 26260,
    "endMs": 28520,
    "timestampMs": 26260,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You can build a regression with 0.94 R-square value,",
    "startMs": 30560,
    "endMs": 34200,
    "timestampMs": 30560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "a clean pipeline, six months of feature engineering,",
    "startMs": 34200,
    "endMs": 37520,
    "timestampMs": 34200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and then paste a default Matplotlib figure like this one",
    "startMs": 37520,
    "endMs": 41600,
    "timestampMs": 37520,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "into the slide deck, gray background, blue background",
    "startMs": 41600,
    "endMs": 44920,
    "timestampMs": 41600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and all, and watch everyone in the room quietly decide",
    "startMs": 44920,
    "endMs": 48960,
    "timestampMs": 44920,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "you don't know what you are saying.",
    "startMs": 48960,
    "endMs": 51280,
    "timestampMs": 48960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I remember sending a client a notebook",
    "startMs": 51280,
    "endMs": 53600,
    "timestampMs": 51280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I was genuinely proud of, six weeks of analysis,",
    "startMs": 53600,
    "endMs": 57140,
    "timestampMs": 53600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "solid methodology, results I stood behind.",
    "startMs": 57140,
    "endMs": 60560,
    "timestampMs": 57140,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The feedback I got wasn't about any of that.",
    "startMs": 60560,
    "endMs": 63260,
    "timestampMs": 60560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The first comment was,",
    "startMs": 63260,
    "endMs": 64820,
    "timestampMs": 63260,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "these charts are really hard to read.",
    "startMs": 64820,
    "endMs": 67020,
    "timestampMs": 64820,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That was it.",
    "startMs": 67020,
    "endMs": 68220,
    "timestampMs": 67020,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That was the conversation.",
    "startMs": 68220,
    "endMs": 70100,
    "timestampMs": 68220,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The analysis became secondary.",
    "startMs": 70100,
    "endMs": 72220,
    "timestampMs": 70100,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The moment the charts made people work.",
    "startMs": 72220,
    "endMs": 75020,
    "timestampMs": 72220,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I have never sent a default Matplotlib figure since.",
    "startMs": 75020,
    "endMs": 78380,
    "timestampMs": 75020,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Visualization is where your analytics",
    "startMs": 78380,
    "endMs": 81060,
    "timestampMs": 78380,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "either lands or disappears.",
    "startMs": 81060,
    "endMs": 83260,
    "timestampMs": 81060,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It's not cosmetic, it's communication.",
    "startMs": 83260,
    "endMs": 85620,
    "timestampMs": 83260,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And in Python, you have two tools",
    "startMs": 85620,
    "endMs": 87660,
    "timestampMs": 85620,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "that handle 95% of everything you will ever need.",
    "startMs": 87660,
    "endMs": 91180,
    "timestampMs": 87660,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Matplotlib for control, Seaborn for speed.",
    "startMs": 91180,
    "endMs": 94940,
    "timestampMs": 91180,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "This tutorial is five of 10.",
    "startMs": 94940,
    "endMs": 97660,
    "timestampMs": 94940,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "By the end, you will never paste a gray background plot again.",
    "startMs": 97660,
    "endMs": 101780,
    "timestampMs": 97660,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So this is the Seaborn documentation.",
    "startMs": 101780,
    "endMs": 104780,
    "timestampMs": 101780,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You can go and take a look in tutorials.",
    "startMs": 104780,
    "endMs": 107940,
    "timestampMs": 104780,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And if you want to take a look at API as well.",
    "startMs": 109380,
    "endMs": 112760,
    "timestampMs": 109380,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And if you take a look at Matplotlib.",
    "startMs": 113680,
    "endMs": 116160,
    "timestampMs": 113680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Matplotlib also has a quite decent documentation.",
    "startMs": 123040,
    "endMs": 127760,
    "timestampMs": 123040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You can take a look at tutorials, examples, API reference.",
    "startMs": 127760,
    "endMs": 132360,
    "timestampMs": 127760,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Here is what most tutorials skip",
    "startMs": 132360,
    "endMs": 134280,
    "timestampMs": 132360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "about Matplotlib and Seaborn.",
    "startMs": 134280,
    "endMs": 136840,
    "timestampMs": 134280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "They're not competing libraries, they're layers.",
    "startMs": 136840,
    "endMs": 139680,
    "timestampMs": 136840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Seaborn is built on top of Matplotlib.",
    "startMs": 139720,
    "endMs": 143000,
    "timestampMs": 139720,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It gives you high level plot types",
    "startMs": 143000,
    "endMs": 145240,
    "timestampMs": 143000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "that look good with almost no configuration.",
    "startMs": 145240,
    "endMs": 148320,
    "timestampMs": 145240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Matplotlib gives you low level control",
    "startMs": 148320,
    "endMs": 150880,
    "timestampMs": 148320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "when the Seaborn defaults are not enough.",
    "startMs": 150880,
    "endMs": 153800,
    "timestampMs": 150880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The mental model here is Seaborn for the 80%",
    "startMs": 153800,
    "endMs": 157520,
    "timestampMs": 153800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and Matplotlib for the last 20%.",
    "startMs": 157520,
    "endMs": 161200,
    "timestampMs": 157520,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Most of your plots, distributions, correlations,",
    "startMs": 161200,
    "endMs": 164120,
    "timestampMs": 161200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "category comparison can be written",
    "startMs": 164120,
    "endMs": 166360,
    "timestampMs": 164120,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "in three to five lines of Seaborn.",
    "startMs": 166360,
    "endMs": 168960,
    "timestampMs": 166360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The cleanup, titles, font sizes,",
    "startMs": 168960,
    "endMs": 171320,
    "timestampMs": 168960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "saving to file, that's Matplotlib.",
    "startMs": 171320,
    "endMs": 173960,
    "timestampMs": 171320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "We will use the Titanic dataset throughout.",
    "startMs": 173960,
    "endMs": 176680,
    "timestampMs": 173960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It's built into Seaborn, no download is required.",
    "startMs": 176680,
    "endMs": 179920,
    "timestampMs": 176680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Before we even move forward,",
    "startMs": 179920,
    "endMs": 182240,
    "timestampMs": 179920,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "we need to first install Matplotlib and Seaborn.",
    "startMs": 182240,
    "endMs": 185560,
    "timestampMs": 182240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So if you remember from our first tutorial,",
    "startMs": 185560,
    "endMs": 188320,
    "timestampMs": 185560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "we should always activate our virtual environment.",
    "startMs": 188320,
    "endMs": 191680,
    "timestampMs": 188320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I have activated it.",
    "startMs": 191680,
    "endMs": 193240,
    "timestampMs": 191680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Since I already have it installed,",
    "startMs": 193240,
    "endMs": 195440,
    "timestampMs": 193240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "it will show me that, but you can install it fresh.",
    "startMs": 195440,
    "endMs": 198360,
    "timestampMs": 195440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now that we have installed our packages.",
    "startMs": 199840,
    "endMs": 203040,
    "timestampMs": 199840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So before we even plot a single point,",
    "startMs": 203040,
    "endMs": 206800,
    "timestampMs": 203040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "we need to establish some visual defaults.",
    "startMs": 206800,
    "endMs": 209560,
    "timestampMs": 206800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "This block will go at the top of every notebook",
    "startMs": 209560,
    "endMs": 212360,
    "timestampMs": 209560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "that you create.",
    "startMs": 212360,
    "endMs": 213560,
    "timestampMs": 212360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So let me just show you what I'm talking about.",
    "startMs": 213560,
    "endMs": 216320,
    "timestampMs": 213560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So let's split it.",
    "startMs": 221400,
    "endMs": 222760,
    "timestampMs": 221400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So first we import whatever is required.",
    "startMs": 225320,
    "endMs": 227960,
    "timestampMs": 225320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Then we set the baseline theme",
    "startMs": 229960,
    "endMs": 233640,
    "timestampMs": 229960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and some parameters for plots.",
    "startMs": 233640,
    "endMs": 236760,
    "timestampMs": 233640,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And then we load the dataset.",
    "startMs": 238280,
    "endMs": 239920,
    "timestampMs": 238280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So we load it in data frame DF,",
    "startMs": 239920,
    "endMs": 243320,
    "timestampMs": 239920,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "the Titanic dataset, and let's see how does it look.",
    "startMs": 243320,
    "endMs": 246720,
    "timestampMs": 243320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It has quite a few number of features",
    "startMs": 246720,
    "endMs": 248840,
    "timestampMs": 246720,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and we just see the head.",
    "startMs": 248840,
    "endMs": 250960,
    "timestampMs": 248840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So three things that really matter here.",
    "startMs": 250960,
    "endMs": 254000,
    "timestampMs": 250960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "First is this sns.set theme.",
    "startMs": 254000,
    "endMs": 257080,
    "timestampMs": 254000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It kills the gray background,",
    "startMs": 257080,
    "endMs": 258520,
    "timestampMs": 257080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "replaces it with a clean white area",
    "startMs": 258560,
    "endMs": 260440,
    "timestampMs": 258560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and light horizontal grid lines.",
    "startMs": 260440,
    "endMs": 262880,
    "timestampMs": 260440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Font scale 1.2 bumps all text up 20%.",
    "startMs": 262880,
    "endMs": 266880,
    "timestampMs": 262880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Default Matplotlib fonts were designed for small monitors.",
    "startMs": 266880,
    "endMs": 270440,
    "timestampMs": 266880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "They are too small for slides,",
    "startMs": 270440,
    "endMs": 272080,
    "timestampMs": 270440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "too small for anything you will ever share.",
    "startMs": 272080,
    "endMs": 274480,
    "timestampMs": 272080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And removing the top and right spines,",
    "startMs": 274480,
    "endMs": 277800,
    "timestampMs": 274480,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "those box lines around your chart is a design decision",
    "startMs": 277800,
    "endMs": 281160,
    "timestampMs": 277800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "backed by Edward Tufts data ink ratio principle.",
    "startMs": 281160,
    "endMs": 284840,
    "timestampMs": 281160,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Every non-data element should justify its existence.",
    "startMs": 284840,
    "endMs": 288120,
    "timestampMs": 284840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The borders add no information, remove them.",
    "startMs": 288120,
    "endMs": 290960,
    "timestampMs": 288120,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Your chart looks cleaner immediately.",
    "startMs": 290960,
    "endMs": 293400,
    "timestampMs": 290960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I actually learned the spine thing",
    "startMs": 293400,
    "endMs": 294840,
    "timestampMs": 293400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "from a code review, not a tutorial.",
    "startMs": 294840,
    "endMs": 296920,
    "timestampMs": 294840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Someone looked at one of my charts and asked,",
    "startMs": 296920,
    "endMs": 299000,
    "timestampMs": 296920,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "what are those border lines doing there?",
    "startMs": 299000,
    "endMs": 301440,
    "timestampMs": 299000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And I did not have an answer.",
    "startMs": 301440,
    "endMs": 303320,
    "timestampMs": 301440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "They are just there by default.",
    "startMs": 303320,
    "endMs": 306040,
    "timestampMs": 303320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I removed them, looked at the before and after.",
    "startMs": 306040,
    "endMs": 309240,
    "timestampMs": 306040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The chart immediately felt less boxed in.",
    "startMs": 309240,
    "endMs": 312280,
    "timestampMs": 309240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That was three or four years ago.",
    "startMs": 312280,
    "endMs": 314360,
    "timestampMs": 312280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It's been in my baseline since.",
    "startMs": 314360,
    "endMs": 316920,
    "timestampMs": 314360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Set this once per session.",
    "startMs": 316920,
    "endMs": 319080,
    "timestampMs": 316920,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Every plot in the notebook inherits it.",
    "startMs": 319080,
    "endMs": 321440,
    "timestampMs": 319080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now we will see five plot types.",
    "startMs": 321440,
    "endMs": 324400,
    "timestampMs": 321440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Learn these code and you will cover 90%",
    "startMs": 324400,
    "endMs": 326560,
    "timestampMs": 324400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "of exploratory analysis.",
    "startMs": 326560,
    "endMs": 328600,
    "timestampMs": 326560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now we are going to talk about the distribution graph first.",
    "startMs": 328600,
    "endMs": 332200,
    "timestampMs": 328600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "There is a sns.hist plot.",
    "startMs": 332200,
    "endMs": 335200,
    "timestampMs": 332200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So let me just write it for you, sns.hist plot",
    "startMs": 335200,
    "endMs": 339160,
    "timestampMs": 335200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "with kde equal to true.",
    "startMs": 341680,
    "endMs": 346000,
    "timestampMs": 341680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So this gives us the shape and density together.",
    "startMs": 346920,
    "endMs": 351920,
    "timestampMs": 346920,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So let's just write a code.",
    "startMs": 353880,
    "endMs": 355920,
    "timestampMs": 353880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So I am creating two subplots.",
    "startMs": 359480,
    "endMs": 361720,
    "timestampMs": 359480,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "One is his plot of age and one of fair.",
    "startMs": 361720,
    "endMs": 366160,
    "timestampMs": 361720,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So let's just first see it.",
    "startMs": 366160,
    "endMs": 368600,
    "timestampMs": 366160,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So what it does is you can see age",
    "startMs": 368600,
    "endMs": 370480,
    "timestampMs": 368600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "is roughly normally distributed here.",
    "startMs": 370480,
    "endMs": 373080,
    "timestampMs": 370480,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Fair is heavily skewed towards one side.",
    "startMs": 373080,
    "endMs": 377000,
    "timestampMs": 373080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Most passengers paid under 50 pounds,",
    "startMs": 377000,
    "endMs": 380680,
    "timestampMs": 377000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "but some paid over 500 pounds as well, as you can see here.",
    "startMs": 380680,
    "endMs": 384360,
    "timestampMs": 380680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That asymmetry matters the moment you consider fair",
    "startMs": 384360,
    "endMs": 387200,
    "timestampMs": 384360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "as a model feature.",
    "startMs": 387200,
    "endMs": 388840,
    "timestampMs": 387200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "For relationship between two numeric variables,",
    "startMs": 388840,
    "endMs": 391680,
    "timestampMs": 388840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "sns.scatterplot with a hue parameter encodes",
    "startMs": 391680,
    "endMs": 394840,
    "timestampMs": 391680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "a third variable with color.",
    "startMs": 394840,
    "endMs": 396280,
    "timestampMs": 394840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "In this case, survival.",
    "startMs": 396280,
    "endMs": 397960,
    "timestampMs": 396280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "High fair passengers cluster with more survivors.",
    "startMs": 397960,
    "endMs": 401240,
    "timestampMs": 397960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "For categorical comparisons,",
    "startMs": 401240,
    "endMs": 403280,
    "timestampMs": 401240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "sns.parplot gives you confidence intervals automatically.",
    "startMs": 403280,
    "endMs": 406960,
    "timestampMs": 403280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "First class survival roughly 63%,",
    "startMs": 406960,
    "endMs": 410520,
    "timestampMs": 406960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "third class drops below 25%.",
    "startMs": 410520,
    "endMs": 413080,
    "timestampMs": 410520,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
