    "startMs": 416320,
    "endMs": 417600,
    "timestampMs": 416320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "gives you the full feature correlation matrix",
    "startMs": 417600,
    "endMs": 420040,
    "timestampMs": 417600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "in under 10 lines.",
    "startMs": 420040,
    "endMs": 422000,
    "timestampMs": 420040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And sns.boxplot shows distribution across groups,",
    "startMs": 422000,
    "endMs": 425680,
    "timestampMs": 422000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "age by passenger class, median and outliers both visible.",
    "startMs": 425680,
    "endMs": 430680,
    "timestampMs": 425680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So let's first talk about this plot",
