    "startMs": 432840,
    "endMs": 436080,
    "timestampMs": 432840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So here what we are doing is",
    "startMs": 436080,
    "endMs": 437200,
    "timestampMs": 436080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "we are creating two histogram plots.",
    "startMs": 437200,
    "endMs": 439880,
    "timestampMs": 437200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "First is for age and its distribution",
    "startMs": 439880,
    "endMs": 443640,
    "timestampMs": 439880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "with the color defined and the labels",
    "startMs": 443640,
    "endMs": 446960,
    "timestampMs": 443640,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and the title defined and then another one for fair.",
    "startMs": 446960,
    "endMs": 450160,
    "timestampMs": 446960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And I explained to you how do they fair",
    "startMs": 450160,
    "endMs": 453840,
    "timestampMs": 450160,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "in terms of their distribution.",
    "startMs": 453840,
    "endMs": 456080,
    "timestampMs": 453840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now let's take a look at the other plots.",
    "startMs": 456080,
    "endMs": 458440,
    "timestampMs": 456080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay, so all of the plots that I told you just now.",
    "startMs": 460760,
    "endMs": 463880,
    "timestampMs": 460760,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "We have a histogram, we have a scatterplot,",
    "startMs": 463880,
    "endMs": 466920,
    "timestampMs": 463880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "we have a barplot, we have a heatmap, we have a boxplot.",
    "startMs": 466920,
    "endMs": 469760,
    "timestampMs": 466920,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So as I explained earlier as well,",
    "startMs": 469760,
    "endMs": 471600,
    "timestampMs": 469760,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "in histogram, it's the same plot as earlier,",
    "startMs": 471600,
    "endMs": 475360,
    "timestampMs": 471600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "but in scatterplot, we have zero for survival",
    "startMs": 475360,
    "endMs": 478840,
    "timestampMs": 475360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and one for survived.",
    "startMs": 478840,
    "endMs": 480840,
    "timestampMs": 478840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "We can see that people who paid more fair survived more.",
    "startMs": 480840,
    "endMs": 484960,
    "timestampMs": 480840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "People who paid less fair survived less.",
    "startMs": 484960,
    "endMs": 487800,
    "timestampMs": 484960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "In barplot, we have the confidence intervals automatically.",
    "startMs": 487840,
    "endMs": 491560,
    "timestampMs": 487840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "First class survived roughly 60% of the time",
    "startMs": 491560,
    "endMs": 495160,
    "timestampMs": 491560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "with some interval of confidence,",
    "startMs": 495160,
    "endMs": 498000,
    "timestampMs": 495160,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "same as class two and class three.",
    "startMs": 498000,
    "endMs": 500760,
    "timestampMs": 498000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "If we take a look at the heatmap,",
    "startMs": 500760,
    "endMs": 502800,
    "timestampMs": 500760,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "so we can see how does correlation comes into picture.",
    "startMs": 502800,
    "endMs": 506560,
    "timestampMs": 502800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Fair being high means survival is high.",
    "startMs": 506560,
    "endMs": 510280,
    "timestampMs": 506560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "High fair, high survival.",
    "startMs": 510280,
    "endMs": 512400,
    "timestampMs": 510280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And age does not have any positive correlation,",
    "startMs": 512400,
    "endMs": 516200,
    "timestampMs": 512400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "same as priority class which survived.",
    "startMs": 516200,
    "endMs": 519080,
    "timestampMs": 516200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So you can see that.",
    "startMs": 519080,
    "endMs": 520240,
    "timestampMs": 519080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now in the boxplot, it shows distribution across groups.",
    "startMs": 520240,
    "endMs": 523880,
    "timestampMs": 520240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So how did the distribution of each priority class",
    "startMs": 523880,
    "endMs": 527840,
    "timestampMs": 523880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "look in terms of age?",
    "startMs": 527840,
    "endMs": 529640,
    "timestampMs": 527840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So most of priority one were in the age of mid",
    "startMs": 529640,
    "endMs": 533400,
    "timestampMs": 529640,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "or late 20s till late 40s,",
    "startMs": 533400,
    "endMs": 536400,
    "timestampMs": 533400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "whereas class two was mid 20s till mid 30s",
    "startMs": 536400,
    "endMs": 540520,
    "timestampMs": 536400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and class three were late teenage till early 30s.",
    "startMs": 540520,
    "endMs": 544640,
    "timestampMs": 540520,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Here is where people get stuck.",
    "startMs": 544640,
    "endMs": 546640,
    "timestampMs": 544640,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "They want to combine these into one figure and it breaks.",
    "startMs": 546640,
    "endMs": 550200,
    "timestampMs": 546640,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The key insight is that every seaborn call",
    "startMs": 550200,
    "endMs": 553240,
    "timestampMs": 550200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "returns a matplotib object.",
    "startMs": 553240,
    "endMs": 555960,
    "timestampMs": 553240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Once you know that, the two libraries become one tool.",
    "startMs": 555960,
    "endMs": 558920,
    "timestampMs": 555960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So this is more or less a dashboard kind of an output",
    "startMs": 562040,
    "endMs": 565360,
    "timestampMs": 562040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "where all four charts with consistent styling",
    "startMs": 565360,
    "endMs": 568760,
    "timestampMs": 565360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and shared subtitle.",
    "startMs": 568760,
    "endMs": 570880,
    "timestampMs": 568760,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So four charts consistent styling,",
    "startMs": 570920,
    "endMs": 573560,
    "timestampMs": 570920,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "a shared title under 25 lines,",
    "startMs": 573560,
    "endMs": 576400,
    "timestampMs": 573560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "as you can see here in this code.",
    "startMs": 576400,
    "endMs": 578280,
    "timestampMs": 576400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And when you look at this together,",
    "startMs": 578280,
    "endMs": 579760,
    "timestampMs": 578280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "your eye sees what you would miss chart by chart.",
    "startMs": 579760,
    "endMs": 583440,
    "timestampMs": 579760,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Survival drops hard from class one to class three.",
    "startMs": 583440,
    "endMs": 586800,
    "timestampMs": 583440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So you can see here from 63% to somewhere around 25%.",
    "startMs": 586800,
    "endMs": 591800,
    "timestampMs": 586800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And the male-female survival gap is enormous.",
    "startMs": 592080,
    "endMs": 595040,
    "timestampMs": 592080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So if we take a look at survival rate by sex,",
    "startMs": 595040,
    "endMs": 598960,
    "timestampMs": 595040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "you can see only about 18, 19% of males survived,",
    "startMs": 598960,
    "endMs": 603360,
    "timestampMs": 598960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "whereas 70 or out of the survivors,",
    "startMs": 603360,
    "endMs": 607080,
    "timestampMs": 603360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "18, 19% were males and more than 70% were females.",
    "startMs": 607080,
    "endMs": 611680,
    "timestampMs": 607080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "First time I put something like this together",
    "startMs": 611680,
    "endMs": 615360,
    "timestampMs": 611680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "for a stakeholder meeting, it changed the whole dynamic.",
    "startMs": 615360,
    "endMs": 618800,
    "timestampMs": 615360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Before that, I was going slide by slide, chart by chart,",
    "startMs": 618800,
    "endMs": 621880,
    "timestampMs": 618800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and I was doing all the connecting out loud.",
    "startMs": 621880,
    "endMs": 625600,
    "timestampMs": 621880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "With the dashboard up,",
    "startMs": 625600,
    "endMs": 626960,
    "timestampMs": 625600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "someone in the room pointed out at the class breakdown",
    "startMs": 626960,
    "endMs": 629920,
    "timestampMs": 626960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and sex breakdown at the same time.",
    "startMs": 629920,
    "endMs": 631960,
    "timestampMs": 629920,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And they said, these two are related, aren't they?",
    "startMs": 631960,
    "endMs": 635080,
    "timestampMs": 631960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "They made the connection themselves.",
    "startMs": 635080,
    "endMs": 637040,
    "timestampMs": 635080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I didn't have to lead them there.",
    "startMs": 637040,
    "endMs": 639480,
    "timestampMs": 637040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That's the difference between a chart and a dashboard.",
    "startMs": 639480,
    "endMs": 642560,
    "timestampMs": 639480,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Last thing, save it right.",
    "startMs": 642560,
    "endMs": 644720,
    "timestampMs": 642560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Default Matplotlib saves at 72 DPI.",
    "startMs": 644720,
    "endMs": 647960,
    "timestampMs": 644720,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Most presentation software renders at 150 to 300.",
    "startMs": 647960,
    "endMs": 651560,
    "timestampMs": 647960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Your chart gets stressed and fuzzy on a projector.",
    "startMs": 651560,
    "endMs": 654640,
    "timestampMs": 651560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Fix this at save time.",
    "startMs": 654640,
    "endMs": 656360,
    "timestampMs": 654640,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "To do this, this is what we can do.",
    "startMs": 656360,
    "endMs": 658880,
    "timestampMs": 656360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So we fix DPI to 300, and if I run this,",
    "startMs": 658880,
    "endMs": 662600,
    "timestampMs": 658880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "it will save to titaniceda-dashboard.png.",
    "startMs": 662600,
    "endMs": 666080,
    "timestampMs": 662600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "If I open it, you can see it's quite clear.",
    "startMs": 666080,
    "endMs": 670200,
    "timestampMs": 666080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So if I go back to code again,",
    "startMs": 670200,
    "endMs": 672280,
    "timestampMs": 670200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "the bbox underscore inch is equal to tight,",
    "startMs": 673680,
    "endMs": 675800,
    "timestampMs": 673680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "it prevents cropping.",
    "startMs": 675800,
    "endMs": 677320,
    "timestampMs": 675800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Face color equal to white looks or locks the background",
    "startMs": 677320,
    "endMs": 680960,
    "timestampMs": 677320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "even in the dark mode notebooks.",
    "startMs": 680960,
    "endMs": 682960,
    "timestampMs": 680960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "For publication of printing, save it as SVG,",
    "startMs": 682960,
    "endMs": 686680,
    "timestampMs": 682960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "resolution independent, scales to any size.",
    "startMs": 686680,
    "endMs": 689400,
    "timestampMs": 686680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Three chart details that separate,",
    "startMs": 689400,
    "endMs": 691800,
    "timestampMs": 689400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "three chart details that separate good from bad.",
    "startMs": 691800,
    "endMs": 694520,
    "timestampMs": 691800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Every numeric axis needs unit.",
    "startMs": 694520,
    "endMs": 697000,
    "timestampMs": 694520,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So fair with pounds, you can see here, not fair only.",
    "startMs": 697000,
    "endMs": 701440,
    "timestampMs": 697000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Color assignment must stay consistent.",
    "startMs": 701440,
    "endMs": 704240,
    "timestampMs": 701440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "If survived is steel blue in chart one,",
    "startMs": 704240,
    "endMs": 707120,
    "timestampMs": 704240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "it's steel blue everywhere.",
    "startMs": 707120,
    "endMs": 709000,
    "timestampMs": 707120,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Use a palette dictionary to enforce it.",
    "startMs": 709000,
    "endMs": 712040,
    "timestampMs": 709000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And the bar charts always start at zero, always.",
    "startMs": 712040,
    "endMs": 715200,
    "timestampMs": 712040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Matplotlib won't enforce this for you.",
    "startMs": 715200,
    "endMs": 717800,
    "timestampMs": 715200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So you can add plot.ylimit01 explicitly.",
    "startMs": 717800,
    "endMs": 721600,
    "timestampMs": 717800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So if we do that and run the chart again,",
    "startMs": 721600,
    "endMs": 725680,
    "timestampMs": 721600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "it doesn't make a difference here too much,",
    "startMs": 731320,
    "endMs": 733360,
    "timestampMs": 731320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "but if your data would have been like",
    "startMs": 733360,
    "endMs": 736800,
    "timestampMs": 733360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "where it did not start from zero or near to zero,",
    "startMs": 736800,
    "endMs": 740520,
    "timestampMs": 736800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "it would have limited it between zero and one.",
    "startMs": 740520,
    "endMs": 743320,
    "timestampMs": 740520,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So these aren't design skills, they're intentions.",
    "startMs": 743320,
    "endMs": 748120,
    "timestampMs": 743320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And they are the difference between a chart that communicates",
    "startMs": 748120,
    "endMs": 750560,
    "timestampMs": 748120,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and a chart that misleads.",
    "startMs": 750560,
    "endMs": 752320,
    "timestampMs": 750560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So let's take a look at another example.",
    "startMs": 752320,
    "endMs": 754320,
    "timestampMs": 752320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So you can see before styling and after styling,",
    "startMs": 757280,
    "endMs": 760760,
    "timestampMs": 757280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "the difference that you can see quite nicely.",
    "startMs": 760760,
    "endMs": 764240,
    "timestampMs": 760760,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "So I would say start with one notebook,",
    "startMs": 764240,
    "endMs": 766040,
    "timestampMs": 764240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "load a data set you care about,",
    "startMs": 766040,
    "endMs": 768080,
    "timestampMs": 766040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "build all five chart types, save at 300 DPI,",
    "startMs": 768080,
    "endMs": 771960,
    "timestampMs": 768080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "then ask, does someone who has never seen this data",
    "startMs": 771960,
    "endMs": 774520,
    "timestampMs": 771960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "understand the key pattern within five seconds of looking?",
    "startMs": 774520,
    "endMs": 778200,
    "timestampMs": 774520,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "If not, the chart needs work, not the data.",
    "startMs": 778200,
    "endMs": 781080,
    "timestampMs": 778200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "In the next tutorial, I will talk about statistical testing",
    "startMs": 782000,
    "endMs": 785960,
    "timestampMs": 782000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "with SciPy and stats model.",
    "startMs": 785960,
    "endMs": 788440,
    "timestampMs": 785960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "We'll take these patterns and start asking",
    "startMs": 788440,
    "endMs": 790320,
    "timestampMs": 788440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "whether what we see is actually real.",
    "startMs": 790320,
    "endMs": 793360,
    "timestampMs": 790320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "If this series is useful,",
    "startMs": 793360,
    "endMs": 795200,
    "timestampMs": 793360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "share it with one person who is learning Python right now",
    "startMs": 795200,
    "endMs": 798040,
    "timestampMs": 795200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and not bookmarking it, sharing it.",
    "startMs": 799040,
    "endMs": 800640,
    "timestampMs": 799040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That's what keeps this going.",
    "startMs": 800640,
